## Make text easy to read

Keep the text readable on every screen. Follow these rules:

- use bold for a few words, not whole paragraphs
- do not use italics for an instruction people need to follow
- do not use pale grey text: use the supporting text colour on [Web-app colours](colour-web-app.html#functional-colours)
- do not write a whole label in capitals

[Text formatting](../content/formatting-content/text-formatting.html) explains when to use bold, capitals and quotes in writing.
